hadiths[129]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek din logon ke samne tashreef farma they ke ek shakhs Aap ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Iman kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Iman ye hai ke tum Allah par, Us ke farishton par, Us se mulaqat par, Us ke Rasoolon par iman lao aur dobara uthaye jane par iman rakho. Us ne poochha: Islam kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Islam ye hai ke tum Allah ki ibadat karo aur Us ke sath kisi ko shareek na karo, namaz qaim karo, farz zakat ada karo aur Ramazan ke roze rakho. Us ne poochha: Ihsan kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke tum Allah ki ibadat aise karo goya tum Use dekh rahe ho, phir agar tum Use nahi dekhte to beshak Wo tumhe dekh raha hai. Us ne poochha: Qayamat kab aayegi? Aap ne farmaya: Jis se poochha gaya hai wo poochhne wale se zyada nahi janta, aur main tumhe us ki alamaton ke bare mein batata hun: jab londi apne aaqa ko janegi, aur jab oonton ke gumnam charwahe imaraton mein ek doosre se unche banne lagen, phir wo paanch batein hain jinhe Allah ke siwa koi nahi janta, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye ayat tilawat farmayi [beshak Allah hi ke paas qayamat ka ilm hai] ayat tak. Phir wo shakhs peeth pher kar chala gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Use wapas lao, lekin unhon ne kuchh na dekha, to Aap ne farmaya: Ye Jibreel they jo logon ko un ka deen sikhane aaye they."
"6","[AI-translation] Hazrat Talha bin Ubaidullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Najd walon mein se ek shakhs Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya, us ke baal bikhre hue they, us ki awaz ki goonj sunayi deti thi lekin samajh mein na aata tha ke wo kya kehta hai, yahan tak ke wo qareeb aaya to maloom hua ke wo Islam ke bare mein poochh raha hai. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Din raat mein paanch namazein hain. Us ne kaha: Kya in ke siwa mujh par kuchh aur hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, magar ye ke tum nafl ada karo. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aur Ramazan ke roze. Us ne kaha: Kya is ke siwa mujh par kuchh aur hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, magar ye ke tum nafl rakho. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se zakat ka zikr farmaya. Us ne kaha: Kya is ke siwa mujh par kuchh aur hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, magar ye ke tum nafl do. Phir wo shakhs peeth pher kar ye kehte hue chala gaya: Allah ki qasam! Main is par na izafa karunga aur na kami karunga. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar ye sachcha raha to kamyab ho gaya."
"7","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe aisa amal batayiye jo mujhe Jannat mein dakhil kar de. To logon ne kaha: Use kya hua, use kya hua. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use zaroorat hai, use kya matlab. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki ibadat karo, Us ke sath kisi ko shareek na karo, namaz qaim karo, zakat ada karo aur sila-rahmi karo, use chhor do. Rawi ne kaha: Goya Aap us waqt apni sawari par they."
"8","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek dehati Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Mujhe aise amal ki rahnumayi farmayiye ke jab main use karun to Jannat mein dakhil ho jaun. Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki ibadat karo, Us ke sath kisi ko shareek na karo, farz namaz qaim karo, farz zakat ada karo aur Ramazan ke roze rakho. Us ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam Jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Main is par kuchh izafa nahi karunga. Phir jab wo peeth pher kar chala gaya to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jise khushi ho ke wo Jannat walon mein se ek shakhs ko dekhe to use chahiye ke is shakhs ko dekhe."
"9","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Islam ki bunyad paanch cheezon par rakhi gayi hai: is baat ki gawahi ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, namaz qaim karne, zakat dene, hajj karne aur Ramazan ke roze rakhne par."
"10","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Abd al-Qais ka wafd Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Ye log kaun hain, ya ye wafd kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rabi'a. Aap ne farmaya: Qaum ko, ya wafd ko khush-aamdeed, na ruswa hue aur na sharminda. To unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Hum hurmat wale mahine ke siwa Aap ke paas nahi aa sakte, aur hamare aur Aap ke darmiyan Muzar ke kafiron ka ye qabeela hail hai, isliye hamein aisa do-took hukm dijiye ke hum apne peechhe rehne walon ko us ki khabar dein aur us ke zariye Jannat mein dakhil hon. Aur unhon ne Aap se mashroobat ke bare mein poochha. To Aap ne unhe chaar baton ka hukm diya aur chaar se mana farmaya: Unhe Allah Wahdahu par iman lane ka hukm diya aur farmaya: Kya tum jante ho Allah Wahdahu par iman kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Is baat ki gawahi ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, namaz qaim karna, zakat dena, Ramazan ke roze rakhna aur maal-e-ghaneemat mein se panchwan hissa dena. Aur unhe chaar cheezon se mana farmaya: hantam [lakri ke bartan], dubba [kaddu ke khushk bartan], naqeer [lakri ke kunde mein bani sharab] aur muzaffat [roghni bartan] se, aur kabhi Aap ne muqayyar farmaya. Aur farmaya: Inhe yaad rakho aur apne peechhe walon ko in ki khabar do."
"11","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jab Hazrat Muadh (raziyallahu anhu) ko Yemen ki taraf bheja to farmaya: Tum anqareeb Ahle Kitab ki ek qaum ke paas pahunchoge, to sab se pehle jis cheez ki tum unhe dawat do wo Allah ki ibadat ho, phir jab wo Allah ko pehchan lein to unhe khabar do ke Allah ne un par un ke din raat mein paanch namazein farz ki hain, phir jab wo ye karne lagen to unhe khabar do ke Allah ne un par un ke maalon mein se zakat farz ki hai jo un ke faqiron ko lautayi jayegi, phir jab wo is mein itaat karen to un se wasool karo aur logon ke umda maalon se bacho."
"12","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hazrat Muadh ko Yemen ki taraf bheja to farmaya: Mazloom ki bad-dua se daro, kyunke us ke aur Allah ke darmiyan koi parda nahi hai."
"13","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Hazrat Abu Bakr aur Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki wafat ho gayi aur Hazrat Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) khalifa bane, aur Arab mein se jis ne kufr kiya us ne kufr kiya, to Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Tum logon se kaise ladoge jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya hai: Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon se ladun yahan tak ke wo kahein ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, to jis ne ye kaha us ne mujh se apna maal aur apni jaan bacha li, magar us ke haq ke sath, aur us ka hisab Allah par hai. To Hazrat Abu Bakr ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor us se ladunga jo namaz aur zakat ke darmiyan farq karega, kyunke zakat maal ka haq hai, aur Allah ki qasam! Agar unhon ne mujhe ek bakri ka bachcha dene se bhi inkar kiya jo wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ada karte they to main un se us ke rokne par ladunga. Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ye is ke siwa kuchh na tha ke Allah ne Hazrat Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ka seena khol diya tha, to main ne jaan liya ke yehi haq hai."
"14","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon se ladun yahan tak ke wo kahein ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, to jis ne kaha ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi us ne mujh se apni jaan aur apna maal bacha liya, magar us ke haq ke sath, aur us ka hisab Allah par hai."
"15","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon se ladun yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, namaz qaim karen aur zakat dein, phir jab unhon ne ye kar liya to unhon ne mujh se apne khoon aur apne maal bacha liye, magar Islam ke haq ke sath, aur un ka hisab Allah par hai."
"16","[AI-translation] Musayyab bin Hazn se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Abu Talib ki wafat ka waqt aaya to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke paas tashreef laye aur us ke paas Abu Jahl bin Hisham aur Abdullah bin Abi Umayyah bin al-Mughira ko paya. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Talib se farmaya: Ae chacha! La ilaha illallah kaho, ek aisa kalima jis ke zariye main Allah ke paas tumhare liye gawahi dun. To Abu Jahl aur Abdullah bin Abi Umayyah ne kaha: Ae Abu Talib! Kya tum Abd al-Muttalib ke deen se munh pheroge? Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) use ye pesh karte rahe aur wo dono usi baat ko dohrate rahe, yahan tak ke Abu Talib ne aakhir mein jo un se kaha wo ye tha ke wo Abd al-Muttalib ke deen par hai, aur us ne La ilaha illallah kehne se inkar kar diya. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Suno! Allah ki qasam! Main tumhare liye zaroor maghfirat talab karunga jab tak mujhe tum se mana na kiya jaye. To Allah Ta'ala ne us ke bare mein ye ayat nazil farmayi [Nabi ke liye jayez nahi] ayat tak."
"17","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Wo akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahi, aur Muhammad Us ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain, aur Isa Allah ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain aur Us ka kalima hain jise Us ne Maryam ki taraf dala aur Us ki taraf se ek rooh hain, aur Jannat haq hai aur Dozakh haq hai, to Allah use Jannat mein dakhil farmayega us ke aamal kuchh bhi hon. Aur sanad ke ek rawi ne izafa kiya: Jannat ke aathon darwazon mein se jis se chahe."
"18","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muadh bin Jabal (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek martaba main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechhe sawar tha, mere aur Aap ke darmiyan kajave ke pichhle hisse ke siwa kuchh na tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muadh! Main ne arz kiya: Labbaik Ya Rasulullah wa sa'daik. Phir Aap kuchh der chalte rahe, phir farmaya: Ae Muadh! Main ne arz kiya: Labbaik Ya Rasulullah wa sa'daik. Phir Aap kuchh der chalte rahe, phir farmaya: Ae Muadh! Main ne arz kiya: Labbaik Ya Rasulullah wa sa'daik. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho bandon par Allah ka haq kya hai? Main ne arz kiya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Bandon par Allah ka haq ye hai ke wo Us ki ibadat karen aur Us ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karen. Phir Aap kuchh der chalte rahe, phir farmaya: Ae Muadh bin Jabal! Main ne arz kiya: Labbaik Ya Rasulullah wa sa'daik. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho jab wo ye kar lein to Allah par bandon ka haq kya hai? Main ne arz kiya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Allah par bandon ka haq ye hai ke Wo unhe azab na de."
"19","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muadh (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechhe ek gadhe par sawar tha jise Ufair kaha jata tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muadh! Kya tum jante ho bandon par Allah ka haq kya hai aur Allah par bandon ka haq kya hai? Main ne arz kiya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Bandon par Allah ka haq ye hai ke wo Us ki ibadat karen aur Us ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karen, aur Allah par bandon ka haq ye hai ke Wo us shakhs ko azab na de jo Us ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na kare. To main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main is se logon ko khush-khabri na dun? Aap ne farmaya: Unhe khush-khabri na do warna wo isi par bharosa kar baithenge."
"20","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Hazrat Muadh Aap ke peechhe kajave par sawar they. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muadh bin Jabal! Unhon ne arz kiya: Labbaik Ya Rasulullah wa sa'daik. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Muadh! Unhon ne arz kiya: Labbaik Ya Rasulullah wa sa'daik, teen martaba. Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs dil ki sachchayi se gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, Allah use Dozakh par haram kar deta hai. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main is se logon ko khabar na dun taake wo khush hon? Aap ne farmaya: Tab wo isi par bharosa kar baithenge. Aur Hazrat Muadh ne ise apni wafat ke waqt ilm chhupane ke gunah se bachne ke liye bayan kiya."
"21","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Iman saath se kuchh zyada shakhein hain, aur haya iman ki ek shaakh hai."
"22","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ansar mein se ek shakhs ke paas se guzre jo apne bhai ko haya ke bare mein naseehat kar raha tha. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use chhor do, kyunke haya iman mein se hai."
"23","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Haya sirf bhalayi lekar aati hai."
"24","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha: Kaun sa Islam behtar hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tum khana khilao aur salam karo use bhi jise tum jante ho aur use bhi jise tum nahi jante."
"25","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Logon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun sa Islam afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jis ki zaban aur hath se Musalman mehfooz rahen."
"26","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Teen batein hain, jis mein hon us ne iman ki mithas pa li: Ye ke Allah aur Us ke Rasool use un ke siwa har cheez se zyada mehboob hon, aur wo kisi shakhs se mohabbat kare to sirf Allah ke liye kare, aur wo kufr ki taraf lautne ko aise na-pasand kare jaise wo Aag mein phenke jane ko na-pasand karta hai."
"27","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi momin nahi ho sakta yahan tak ke main use us ke walid, us ki aulad aur tamam logon se zyada mehboob ho jaun."
"28","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi momin nahi ho sakta yahan tak ke wo apne bhai ke liye wahi pasand kare jo apne liye pasand karta hai."
"29","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke wo apne padosi ko takleef na de, aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke wo apne mehmaan ki izzat kare, aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke wo bhalayi kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"30","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Shurayh al-Adawi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere kanon ne suna aur meri aankhon ne dekha jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne guftagu farmayi. Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke wo apne padosi ki izzat kare, aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke wo apne mehmaan ki izzat kare, us ka inaam. Unhon ne arz kiya: Us ka inaam kya hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Ek din aur ek raat, aur mehmaan-nawazi teen din hai, phir jo is se zyada ho wo us par sadqa hai. Aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke wo bhalayi kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"31","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amr Abu Mas'ud se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne hath se Yemen ki taraf ishara farmaya aur farmaya: Iman Yemeni hai, yahan hai. Suno! Beshak sakhti aur dilon ki sang-dili un zor se chillane wale maweshiyon walon mein hai, oonton ki dumon ki jadon ke paas, jahan se shaitan ke do seeng nikalte hain, Rabi'a aur Muzar mein."
"32","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare paas Ahle Yemen aaye, wo dilon ke aitbar se kamzor tareen aur dimaghon ke aitbar se narm tareen hain. Fiqh Yemeni hai aur hikmat Yemeni hai."
"33","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kufr ka sar mashriq ki taraf hai, aur fakhr aur takabbur ghodon aur oonton walon aur oon wale zor se chillane walon mein hai, aur sukoon bakriyon walon mein hai."
"34","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Fakhr aur takabbur oon wale zor se chillane walon mein hai, sukoon bakriyon walon mein hai, iman Yemeni hai aur hikmat Yemeni hai."
"35","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sunne aur itaat karne par bai'at ki, to Aap ne mujhe sikhaya ke jitna ho sake, aur har Musalman ke sath khair-khwahi par."
"36","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Zina karne wala jab zina karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta, sharab peene wala jab sharab peeta hai to wo momin nahi rehta, chor jab chori karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta. Aur ek riwayat mein izafa hai: Aur lootne wala jab aisi qeemti cheez lootta hai jis ki taraf log apni aankhein uthate hon, jab wo use lootta hai to wo momin nahi rehta."
"37","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Chaar batein hain, jis mein hon wo khalis munafiq hai, aur jis mein in mein se ek khaslat ho us mein nifaq ki ek khaslat hogi yahan tak ke wo use chhor de: Jab use amanat di jaye to khayanat kare, jab baat kare to jhoot bole, jab ahad kare to ahad-shikani kare, aur jab jhagda kare to bad-zabani kare."
"38","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Munafiq ki alamat teen hain: Jab baat kare to jhoot bole, jab wada kare to khilaf-warzi kare, aur jab use amanat di jaye to khayanat kare."
"39","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne bhai se kahe ke ae kafir, to un dono mein se ek is ka mustahiq ho gaya."
"40","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs jaan-boojh kar apne baap ke siwa kisi aur ka beta hone ka dawa kare us ne kufr kiya, aur jo aisi qaum ka dawa kare jis mein us ka nasab nahi to use chahiye ke wo Dozakh mein apna thikana bana le."
"41","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Apne baapon se munh na phero, to jo apne baap se munh pherega wo kufr hai."
"42","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas aur Abu Bakrah se riwayat hai. Sa'd ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo apne baap ke siwa kisi aur ka beta hone ka dawa kare jabke wo janta hai ke wo us ka baap nahi to Jannat us par haram hai. Phir Abu Bakrah se ye zikr kiya gaya to unhon ne kaha: Mere kanon ne suna aur mere dil ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se yaad rakha."
"43","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ko gali dena fisq hai aur us se ladna kufr hai."
"44","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se Hajjat al-Wada mein farmaya: Logon ko khamosh karao, phir farmaya: Mere baad kafir ho kar na lautna ke tum mein se ek doosre ki gardanein marne lage."
"45","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum par afsos, ya tum par hairat, mere baad kafir ho kar na lautna ke tum mein se ek doosre ki gardanein marne lage."
"46","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid al-Juhani (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hudaibiyah mein raat ki barish ke baad hamein Fajr ki namaz parhayi. Phir jab Aap phire to logon ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Kya tum jante ho tumhare Rab ne kya farmaya? Unhon ne arz kiya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Mere bandon mein se koi mujh par iman lane wala aur koi kafir hokar subah karta hai. To jis ne kaha ke hum par Allah ke fazl aur Us ki rehmat se barish hui wo mujh par iman lane wala aur sitare ka inkar karne wala hai. Aur jis ne kaha ke hum par falan aur falan sitare se barish hui wo mera inkar karne wala aur sitare par iman lane wala hai."
"47","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ansar se mohabbat iman ki alamat hai, aur Ansar se bughz nifaq ki alamat hai."
"48","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ansar se sirf momin mohabbat karta hai aur un se sirf munafiq bughz rakhta hai. To jo un se mohabbat kare Allah us se mohabbat karega, aur jo un se bughz rakhe Allah us se bughz rakhega."
"49","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Eid al-Adha ya Eid al-Fitr mein Eidgah ki taraf nikle aur aurton ke paas se guzre to farmaya: Ae aurton ki jamaat! Sadqa karo, kyunke mujhe dikhaya gaya hai ke tum Dozakh walon mein aksariyat ho. Unhon ne arz kiya: Kis wajah se Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Tum lanat kasrat se karti ho aur shohar ki na-shukri karti ho. Main ne aqal aur deen mein naqis hone ke bawajood tum mein se kisi se badh kar hoshyar mard ki aqal ko le jane wala nahi dekha. Unhon ne arz kiya: Hamare deen aur hamari aqal ka nuqsan kya hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Kya aurat ki gawahi mard ki gawahi ki aadhi nahi? Unhon ne arz kiya: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Ye us ki aqal ka nuqsan hai. Kya jab wo haiz se hoti hai to namaz nahi parhti aur roza nahi rakhti? Unhon ne arz kiya: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Ye us ke deen ka nuqsan hai."
"50","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha gaya: Kaun sa amal afzal hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool par iman. Arz kiya gaya: Phir kya? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke raste mein jihad. Arz kiya gaya: Phir kya? Aap ne farmaya: Hajj-e-Mabroor [wo hajj jo qubool ho aur gunah se paak ho]."
"51","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha: Kaun sa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah par iman aur Us ke raste mein jihad. Main ne arz kiya: To kaun si gardan [ghulam aazad karna] afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo qeemat mein sab se unchi aur apne walon ke nazdeek sab se nafees ho. Main ne arz kiya: Phir agar main ye na karun? Aap ne farmaya: Kisi karigar ki madad karo ya be-hunar ke liye kamao. Main ne arz kiya: Phir agar main ye na karun? Aap ne farmaya: Logon ko shar se mehfooz rakho, kyunke ye ek sadqa hai jo tum apni zaat par karte ho."
"52","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha: Allah ko kaun sa amal sab se mehboob hai? Aap ne farmaya: Namaz apne waqt par. Main ne arz kiya: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Phir walidain se neki. Main ne arz kiya: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke raste mein jihad. Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne mujhe ye batein batayein, aur agar main mazeed poochhta to Aap mujhe mazeed batate."
"53","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha: Allah ke nazdeek sab se bada gunah kaun sa hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke tum Allah ke liye koi shareek banao jabke Us ne tumhe paida kiya. Main ne arz kiya: Beshak ye to bada hai. Main ne arz kiya: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke tum apni aulad ko is dar se qatl karo ke wo tumhare sath khayegi. Main ne arz kiya: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo."
"54","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhe sab se bade kabira gunahon ki khabar na dun? Teen martaba. Unhon ne arz kiya: Kyun nahi Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke sath shirk karna aur walidain ki na-farmani. Aur Aap baith gaye jabke Aap tek lagaye hue they, phir farmaya: Suno! Aur jhooti baat. To Aap ise dohrate rahe yahan tak ke hum ne kaha: Kash Aap khamosh ho jate."
"55","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kabira gunahon ke bare mein poochha gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke sath shirk karna, walidain ki na-farmani, jaan ko qatl karna aur jhooti gawahi."
"56","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Saat halak karne wali cheezon se bacho. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Wo kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke sath shirk karna, jadu, us jaan ko qatl karna jise Allah ne haram kiya magar haq ke sath, sood khana, yateem ka maal khana, ladayi ke din peeth pherna, aur paak-daman momin be-khabar aurton par tohmat lagana."
"57","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sab se bade kabira gunahon mein se ye hai ke aadmi apne walidain par lanat kare. Arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Aadmi apne walidain par kaise lanat karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi kisi shakhs ke baap ko gali deta hai to wo us ke baap ko gali deta hai aur us ki maan ko gali deta hai."
"58","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo is haal mein mare ke wo Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek karta ho wo Dozakh mein dakhil hoga. Aur main ne kaha: Jo is haal mein mare ke wo Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta ho wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"59","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere paas mere Rab ki taraf se aane wala aaya aur mujhe khabar di, ya farmaya mujhe khush-khabri di, ke meri ummat mein se jo is haal mein mare ke wo Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta ho wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. Main ne arz kiya: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho? Aap ne farmaya: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho."
"60","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap par safed kapda tha aur Aap so rahe they, phir main Aap ke paas aaya jab Aap bedar ho chuke they. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo banda La ilaha illallah kahe phir is par mare wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. Main ne arz kiya: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho? Aap ne farmaya: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho. Main ne arz kiya: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho? Aap ne farmaya: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho. Main ne arz kiya: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho? Aap ne farmaya: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho, Abu Dharr ki naak khaak-aalood ho. Aur Abu Dharr jab ye hadith bayan karte to kehte: Agarche Abu Dharr ki naak khaak-aalood ho."
"61","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miqdad bin al-Aswad se riwayat hai [wo Miqdad bin Amr al-Kindi hain] ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya: Batayiye, agar mera samna kafiron mein se ek shakhs se ho aur hum ladne lagen, phir wo talwar se mera ek hath kaat de aur use kaat de, phir mujh se bach kar ek darakht ki panah le aur kahe ke main Allah ke liye musalman ho gaya, to kya Ya Rasulullah! Us ke ye kehne ke baad main use qatl karun? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use qatl na karo. To unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Us ne mera ek hath kaata hai phir us ke kaatne ke baad ye kaha. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use qatl na karo, phir agar tum ne use qatl kiya to wo us darje mein hoga jis mein tum us ke qatl se pehle they, aur tum us darje mein hoge jis mein wo us kalime ke kehne se pehle tha jo us ne kaha."
"62","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein Huraqa ki taraf bheja. To hum ne subah ke waqt qaum par hamla kiya aur unhe shikast di. Aur main aur Ansar mein se ek shakhs un mein se ek shakhs ke peechhe lage. Phir jab hum ne use gher liya to us ne kaha: La ilaha illallah. To Ansari us se ruk gaya aur main ne use apne neze se mara yahan tak ke use qatl kar diya. Phir jab hum aaye to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye baat pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Usama! Kya tum ne use La ilaha illallah kehne ke baad qatl kiya? Main ne arz kiya: Wo panah lene wala tha. To Aap ise dohrate rahe yahan tak ke main ne tamanna ki ke kash main is din se pehle musalman na hua hota."
"63","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne hum par hathyar uthaya wo hum mein se nahi."
"64","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne hum par hathyar uthaya wo hum mein se nahi."
"65","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo rukhsar peete, gireban phaade aur jahiliyat ki pukar pukare wo hum mein se nahi."
"66","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Musa ko sakht dard hua aur un par behoshi tari ho gayi jabke un ka sar un ke ghar walon mein se ek aurat ki god mein tha. To wo use koi jawab na de sake. Phir jab unhe hosh aaya to unhon ne kaha: Main us se bari hun jis se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bari hain. Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) cheekh kar rone wali, sar mundne wali aur kapde phaadne wali se bari hain."
"67","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Chughal-khor Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga."
"68","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Teen shakhs hain jin ki taraf Allah Qayamat ke din na dekhega aur na unhe paak karega aur un ke liye dard-naak azab hai: Ek shakhs jis ke paas raste mein zaroorat se zyada pani ho aur wo use musafir ko dene se roke; aur ek shakhs jo apne imam se bai'at kare aur us se sirf duniya ke liye bai'at kare, phir agar wo use is mein se de to raazi ho aur agar use is mein se na de to naraaz ho; aur ek shakhs jo Asr ke baad apna saman rakhe aur kahe ke Allah ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi! Mujhe is ke badle itna aur itna mil raha tha, to ek shakhs us ki tasdeeq kare. Phir Aap ne ye ayat parhi [beshak jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke badle thodi qeemat khareedte hain]."
"69","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo pahad se gir kar apni jaan le wo Jahannam ki aag mein hoga, is mein girta rahega, is mein hamesha-hamesha rahega. Aur jo zeher pi kar apni jaan le to us ka zeher us ke hath mein hoga, Jahannam ki aag mein use peeta rahega, is mein hamesha-hamesha rahega. Aur jo lohe se apni jaan le to us ka loha us ke hath mein hoga, Jahannam ki aag mein apne pet mein ghonpta rahega, is mein hamesha-hamesha rahega."
"70","[AI-translation] Hazrat Thabit bin al-Dahhak se riwayat hai, jo darakht walon [Bai'at al-Ridwan walon] mein se they, ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Islam ke siwa kisi aur deen par qasam khaye to wo waisa hi hai jaisa us ne kaha. Aur Ibn Adam par us cheez mein nazr jayez nahi jis ka wo malik nahi. Aur jo duniya mein kisi cheez se apni jaan le wo Qayamat ke din isi se azab diya jayega. Aur jo momin par lanat kare wo us ke qatl ki tarah hai, aur jo momin par kufr ki tohmat lagaye wo us ke qatl ki tarah hai."
"71","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Khaibar mein shirkat ki. To Aap ne un mein se ek shakhs ke bare mein jo Islam ka dawa karta tha farmaya: Ye Dozakh walon mein se hai. Phir jab ladayi shuru hui to wo shakhs sakht lada aur use zakhm laga. To arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Jis ke bare mein Aap ne kaha tha ke wo Dozakh walon mein se hai, us ne aaj sakht ladayi ladi hai aur wo mar gaya hai. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Dozakh ki taraf. To kuchh log shak mein padne lage. Isi darmiyan unhe khabar di gayi ke wo mara nahi lekin use sakht zakhm hain. Phir jab raat hui to wo zakhmon par sabr na kar saka aur us ne apni jaan le li. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko is ki khabar di gayi. To Aap ne farmaya: Allahu Akbar! Main gawahi deta hun ke main Allah ka banda aur Us ka Rasool hun. Phir Aap ne Bilal ko hukm diya to unhon ne logon mein elan kiya: Beshak Jannat mein sirf musalman jaan dakhil hogi, aur beshak Allah is deen ki taeed fajir shakhs se bhi karata hai."
"72","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka mushrikon se samna hua aur wo ladne lage. Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne lashkar ki taraf laute aur doosre apne lashkar ki taraf laute, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sathiyon mein ek shakhs tha jo un ki koi chhoti ya badi jamaat nahi chhorta tha magar us ka peechha karke use apni talwar se marta tha. To logon ne kaha: Aaj hum mein se kisi ne itna kaam nahi kiya jitna falan ne kiya. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Suno! Beshak wo Dozakh walon mein se hai. To qaum mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Main us ka sathi hun. To wo us ke sath nikla, jab wo rukta ye us ke sath rukta, aur jab tez chalta ye us ke sath tez chalta. To wo shakhs sakht zakhmi ho gaya aur us ne maut mein jaldi ki. To us ne apni talwar ki nok zameen par rakhi aur us ki dhaar apne dono seene ke darmiyan rakhi, phir apne aap par jhuk gaya aur apni jaan le li. To wo shakhs Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Main gawahi deta hun ke Aap Allah ke Rasool hain. Aap ne farmaya: Wo kya hai? Us ne arz kiya: Wo shakhs jis ka Aap ne abhi zikr farmaya tha ke wo Dozakh walon mein se hai, to logon ne is baat ko bada samjha. To main ne kaha: Main tumhare liye us ka pata lagata hun. Phir main us ki talash mein nikla, phir wo sakht zakhmi hua aur us ne maut mein jaldi ki. To us ne apni talwar ki nok zameen mein rakhi aur us ki dhaar apne seene ke darmiyan rakhi, phir us par jhuk gaya aur apni jaan le li. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us waqt farmaya: Beshak aadmi logon ko zahir mein Jannat walon ke amal karta hai jabke wo Dozakh walon mein se hota hai, aur beshak aadmi logon ko zahir mein Dozakh walon ke amal karta hai jabke wo Jannat walon mein se hota hai."
"73","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jundub bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum se pehle logon mein ek shakhs tha jis ke zakhm tha. To us ne ghabrahat mein chhuri li aur us se apna hath kaat dala. Phir khoon na ruka yahan tak ke wo mar gaya. To Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: Mere bande ne apni jaan ke sath mujh se jaldi ki, main ne us par Jannat haram kar di."
"74","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Khaibar fatah kiya aur hum ne sona aur chandi ghaneemat mein na paya, hum ne sirf gaayen, oont, saman aur baghat ghaneemat mein paye. Phir hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Wadi al-Qura ki taraf laute aur Aap ke sath Aap ka ek ghulam tha jise Mid'am kaha jata tha, use Aap ko Bani al-Dibab mein se ek shakhs ne hadiya kiya tha. To jab wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka kajaava utar raha tha ke use ek bhatka hua teer aaya yahan tak ke us ghulam ko laga. To logon ne kaha: Use shahadat mubarak ho. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kyun nahi, Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak wo chadar jo us ne Khaibar ke din ghaneematon mein se li thi aur taqseem mein nahi aayi thi, us par aag bhadak rahi hai. Phir ek shakhs aaya jab us ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ye suna, ek ya do tasmey lekar. To us ne arz kiya: Ye koi cheez hai jo main ne li thi. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aag ka ek ya do tasmey."
"75","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya hum jahiliyat mein jo amal kiye un par pakde jayenge? Aap ne farmaya: Jo Islam mein acha amal kare wo jahiliyat mein kiye hue par nahi pakda jayega, aur jo Islam mein bura amal kare wo pehle aur pichhle par pakda jayega."
"76","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke shirk walon mein se kuchh log they jinhon ne qatl kiye they aur bahut kiye they, aur zina kiye they aur bahut kiye they. To wo Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur arz kiya: Beshak jo tum kehte ho aur jis ki taraf bulate ho wo acha hai, kash tum hamein khabar do ke hum ne jo amal kiye kya un ka kaffara hai? To ye ayat nazil hui [aur jo Allah ke sath kisi aur mabood ko nahi pukarte aur us jaan ko qatl nahi karte jise Allah ne haram kiya magar haq ke sath, aur zina nahi karte], aur ye nazil hui [kaho ae mere bando jinhon ne apni jaanon par zyadati ki, Allah ki rehmat se mayoos na ho]."
"77","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Batayiye, wo cheezein jin se main jahiliyat mein ibadat ki niyat karta tha, sadqe se ya ghulam aazad karne se aur sila-rahmi se, to kya in mein koi ajr hai? To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum pehle ki hui bhalayi par musalman hue ho."
"78","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye ayat nazil hui [jo iman laye aur unhon ne apne iman ko zulm se aalooda na kiya] to Musalmanon par ye bhari guzri. To unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Hum mein se kaun hai jo apni jaan par zulm nahi karta? Aap ne farmaya: Ye wo nahi, ye to shirk hai. Kya tum ne nahi suna jo Luqman ne apne bete se use naseehat karte hue kaha [ae mere bete! Allah ke sath shirk na kar, beshak shirk bada zulm hai]."
"79","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne meri ummat se us ko muaf kar diya jo un ke dilon mein khayal aaye jab tak wo amal na karen ya bol na dein."
"80","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apna Islam acha kare to har neki jo wo karta hai us ke liye dus guna likhi jati hai, saat sau guna tak, aur har burayi jo wo karta hai us ke liye us jaisi ek likhi jati hai."
"81","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se, us hadith mein jo Aap apne Rab Azza wa Jalla se riwayat karte hain, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne nekiyan aur buraiyan likh di hain, phir is ki wazahat farmayi. To jo neki ka irada kare phir use na kare to Allah use apne paas poori ek neki likhta hai. Phir agar wo us ka irada kare aur use kare to Allah use apne paas dus nekiyan likhta hai, saat sau guna tak, bahut se guna tak. Aur jo burayi ka irada kare phir use na kare to Allah use apne paas poori ek neki likhta hai. Phir agar wo us ka irada kare aur use kare to Allah use us ke liye ek burayi likhta hai."
"82","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Shaitan tum mein se ek ke paas aata hai aur kehta hai: Falan ko kis ne paida kiya, falan ko kis ne paida kiya, yahan tak ke kehta hai: Tumhare Rab ko kis ne paida kiya? Phir jab wo yahan pahunche to use chahiye ke Allah ki panah mange aur ruk jaye."
"83","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Log sawal karte rahenge yahan tak ke kahenge: Ye Allah har cheez ka khaliq hai, to Allah ko kis ne paida kiya?"
"84","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo rok kar qasam khaye taake us se kisi musalman ka maal kaat le, wo Allah se is haal mein milega ke Wo us par ghazab-naak hoga. Phir Allah ne is ki tasdeeq mein ye ayat nazil farmayi [beshak jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke badle thodi qeemat khareedte hain, un ke liye Aakhirat mein koi hissa nahi] ayat ke aakhir tak. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Ash'ath bin Qais dakhil hue aur farmaya: Abu Abd al-Rahman tumhe kya bayan karte hain? Hum ne kaha: Aisa aur aisa. Unhon ne kaha: Ye mere bare mein nazil hui: Mere chacha-zaad bhai ki zameen mein mera ek kunwan tha. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumhari daleel ya us ki qasam. To main ne arz kiya: Tab to wo qasam khayega Ya Rasulullah! To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo rok kar qasam khaye jis se wo kisi musalman ka maal kaat le jabke wo is mein jhoota ho, wo Allah se is haal mein milega ke Wo us par ghazab-naak hoga."
"85","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl kiya jaye wo shaheed hai."
"86","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ma'qil bin Yasar (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ubaidullah bin Ziyad ne us bimari mein un ki ayadat ki jis mein wo faut hue. To Ma'qil ne un se kaha: Main tumhe ek hadith bayan karta hun jo main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suni hai. Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo banda ho jisے Allah kisi riaya ka zimmedar banaye phir wo us ki khair-khwahi se hifazat na kare to wo Jannat ki khushboo nahi payega."
"87","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein do hadithein bayan farmayein, main ne ek dekh li hai aur doosri ka intezar kar raha hun. Hamein bayan farmaya ke amanat mardon ke dilon ki jad mein nazil hui, phir unhon ne Quran se ilm hasil kiya, phir unhon ne Sunnat se ilm hasil kiya. Aur hamein us ke uthaye jane ke bare mein bayan farmaya. Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi ek neend soyega to amanat us ke dil se qabz kar li jayegi, phir us ka nishan khujli ke nishan jaisa reh jayega. Phir wo ek neend soyega to qabz kar li jayegi, phir us ka nishan chhale jaisa reh jayega, jaise angara jo tum ne apne paon par ludhkaya ho, phir wo phool jaye to tum use ubhra hua dekhte ho jabke us mein kuchh nahi hota. Phir log subah karenge aur khareed-farokht karenge to koi amanat ada karne wala na hoga, phir kaha jayega ke falan ke beton mein ek amanat-dar shakhs hai. Aur shakhs ke bare mein kaha jayega ke wo kitna aqal-mand hai, kitna danish-mand hai aur kitna mazboot hai, jabke us ke dil mein rai ke dane ke barabar iman nahi hoga. Aur mujh par ek zamana aaya tha jab mujhe parwah na thi ke tum mein se kis se bai'at karun. Agar wo musalman hota to us ka Islam use meri taraf lauta deta, aur agar wo nasrani hota to us ka karinda use meri taraf lauta deta. Lekin aaj main falan aur falan ke siwa kisi se bai'at nahi karunga."
"88","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas baithe they. To unhon ne farmaya: Tum mein se kaun fitne ke bare mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka qaul yaad rakhta hai? Main ne arz kiya: Main jaisa Aap ne farmaya tha. Unhon ne farmaya: Beshak tum us par ya us ke liye bahut jurrat wale ho. Main ne arz kiya: Aadmi ka fitna us ke ghar walon, maal, aulad aur padosi mein hai, use namaz, roza, sadqa, neki ka hukm aur burayi se rokna mita deta hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Mera matlab ye nahi, lekin wo fitna jo samandar ki tarah mauj marta hai. Main ne arz kiya: Amir al-Muminin! Tumhe is se koi nuqsan nahi, beshak tumhare aur us ke darmiyan ek band darwaza hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Kya wo toda jayega ya khola jayega? Main ne arz kiya: Toda jayega. Unhon ne farmaya: Tab to wo kabhi band nahi hoga. Hum ne poochha: Kya Umar darwaza jante they? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, jaise ke kal se pehle raat hai. Beshak main ne unhe ek hadith bayan ki thi jo ghalat-milt nahi thi. Phir hum Huzaifa se poochhne se dare, to hum ne Masrooq ko hukm diya aur us ne un se poochha. To unhon ne farmaya: Darwaza Umar hain."
"89","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak iman Madina ki taraf simat-ta hai jaise saanp apne bil ki taraf simat-ta hai."
"90","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere liye likho ke logon mein se kis ne Islam ka iqrar kiya hai. To hum ne Aap ke liye pandrah sau mard likhe. Phir hum ne kaha: Hum darte hain jabke hum pandrah sau hain? Phir main ne hamein dekha ke hum aazmaye gaye yahan tak ke aadmi akele namaz parhta tha jabke wo darta tha."
"91","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek jamaat ko ata farmaya jabke Sa'd baithe they. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek shakhs ko chhor diya jo mujhe un mein sab se zyada pasand tha. To main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Falan se Aap ko kya hai? Allah ki qasam! Beshak main use momin samajhta hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Ya musalman. Phir main thodi der khamosh raha, phir jo main us ke bare mein janta tha wo mujh par ghalib aa gaya to main apni baat ki taraf lauta aur arz kiya: Falan se Aap ko kya hai? Allah ki qasam! Beshak main use momin samajhta hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Ya musalman. Phir main thodi der khamosh raha, phir jo main us ke bare mein janta tha wo mujh par ghalib aa gaya to main apni baat ki taraf lauta. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) laute, phir farmaya: Ae Sa'd! Beshak main shakhs ko deta hun jabke doosra mujhe us se zyada mehboob hota hai, is dar se ke kahin Allah use Aag mein na gira de."
"92","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hum Ibrahim se zyada shak ke haq-dar hain jab unhon ne kaha [ae mere Rab! Mujhe dikha ke Tu murdon ko kaise zinda karta hai. Farmaya: Kya tum iman nahi laye? Arz kiya: Kyun nahi, lekin taake mera dil mutma'in ho jaye]. Aur Allah Lut par rehem farmaye, beshak wo mazboot sahare ki panah lete they. Aur agar main qaid mein itna arsa rehta jitna Yusuf rahe to bulane wale ka jawab deta."
"93","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ambiya mein se koi Nabi nahi magar use aisi cheez di gayi jis jaisi par insan iman laye. Aur jo mujhe diya gaya wo wahi hai jo Allah ne meri taraf nazil farmayi. To main ummeed rakhta hun ke Qayamat ke din main un mein sab se zyada pairwi kiye jane wala hunga."
"94","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Teen shakhs hain jin ke liye do ajr hain: Ahle Kitab mein se ek shakhs jo apne Nabi par iman laya aur Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par iman laya; aur mamluk ghulam jab wo Allah ka haq aur apne aaqaon ka haq ada kare; aur ek shakhs jis ke paas ek londi thi, us ne use adab sikhaya aur achhi tarah adab sikhaya, use ilm sikhaya aur achhi tarah sikhaya, phir use aazad kiya aur us se nikah kiya, to us ke liye do ajr hain."
"95","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Anqareeb Ibn Maryam tum mein adil hakim ban kar nazil honge, phir saleeb todenge, khinzeer qatl karenge, jizya khatm karenge, aur maal itna zyada ho jayega ke use koi qubool nahi karega."
"96","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumhara kya haal hoga jab Ibn Maryam tum mein nazil honge aur tumhara imam tumhi mein se hoga?"
"97","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke suraj maghrib se tulu hoga. Phir jab wo tulu hoga aur log use dekhenge to sab iman le aayenge. Aur ye wo waqt hai jab kisi jaan ko us ka iman faida nahi dega. Phir Aap ne ayat parhi."
"98","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baithe they. Phir jab suraj ghuroob ho gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Dharr! Kya tum jante ho ye kahan jata hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye jata hai aur sajde ki ijazat mangta hai to use ijazat di jati hai. Aur goya us se kaha gaya hai ke jahan se aaya hai wahin laut ja, phir wo maghrib se tulu hoga. Phir Aap ne [ye us ka thikana hai] parha."
"99","[AI-translation] Umm al-Muminin Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par wahi ki ibtida neend mein achhe khwabon se hui. Aap koi khwab na dekhte magar wo subah ki roshni ki tarah aa jata. Phir Aap ko tanhayi mehboob bana di gayi, aur Aap Ghar-e-Hira mein tanhayi ikhtiyar karte, us mein ibadat karte, jo ta'abbud hai, muta'addad raatein, apne ghar walon ki taraf lautne se pehle, aur is ke liye tosha lete, phir Khadija ke paas lautte aur is jaisi ke liye tosha lete, yahan tak ke Aap ke paas haq aaya jabke Aap Ghar-e-Hira mein they. To Aap ke paas farishta aaya aur arz kiya: Parho. Aap ne farmaya: Main parhne wala nahi hun. Unhon ne kaha: To us ne mujhe pakda aur mujhe bheencha yahan tak ke mujh se sakhti pahunchi, phir mujhe chhor diya aur kaha: Parho. Main ne arz kiya: Main parhne wala nahi hun. To us ne mujhe pakda aur doosri martaba mujhe bheencha yahan tak ke mujh se sakhti pahunchi, phir mujhe chhor diya aur kaha: Parho. To main ne arz kiya: Main parhne wala nahi hun. To us ne mujhe pakda aur teesri martaba mujhe bheencha, phir mujhe chhor diya aur kaha: [Parho apne Rab ke naam se jis ne paida kiya, insan ko jame hue khoon se paida kiya. Parho aur tumhara Rab sab se zyada karam wala hai]. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ise lekar laute jabke Aap ka dil kaanp raha tha. Phir Khadija bint Khuwailid ke paas dakhil hue aur farmaya: Mujhe chadar odhao, mujhe chadar odhao. To unhon ne Aap ko chadar odhayi yahan tak ke Aap se ghabrahat door ho gayi. Phir Aap ne Khadija ko khabar di aur unhe waqia bataya: Mujhe apni jaan ka dar hua. To Khadija ne farmaya: Hargiz nahi, Allah ki qasam! Allah tumhe kabhi ruswa nahi karega. Beshak tum sila-rahmi karte ho, bojh uthate ho, be-sahara ke liye kamate ho, mehmaan ki khatir karte ho aur haq ki museebaton mein madad karte ho. Phir Khadija Aap ko lekar Warqa bin Naufal bin Asad bin Abd al-Uzza ke paas gayein, jo Khadija ke chacha-zaad bhai they. Wo jahiliyat mein nasrani ho gaye they aur Ibrani kitab likhte they, to Allah ne jo chaha wo Injeel se Ibrani mein likhte they. Wo budhe ho chuke they aur nabina ho gaye they. To Khadija ne un se kaha: Ae chacha-zaad bhai! Apne bhatije se suno. To Warqa ne un se kaha: Ae bhatije! Tum kya dekhte ho? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe khabar di jo Aap ne dekha tha."
"100","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo wahi ke fatrat ke bare mein bayan karte hue kehte hain, Aap ne apni hadith mein farmaya: Main chal raha tha ke main ne aasman se ek awaz suni. To main ne apni nazar uthayi to wo farishta jo Hira mein mere paas aaya tha, aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan ek kursi par baitha tha. To main us se dar gaya aur lauta aur arz kiya: Mujhe chadar odhao. To Allah Ta'ala ne ye nazil farmaya [ae chadar odhne wale! Khade ho aur darao] us ke qaul [aur napaki se door raho] tak. Phir wahi garam ho gayi aur musalsal aane lagi."
"101","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhuma) se Yahya bin Kathir ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne Abu Salama bin Abd al-Rahman se Quran mein sab se pehle nazil hone wali cheez ke bare mein poochha. Unhon ne kaha: Ae chadar odhne wale. Main ne kaha: Log kehte hain ke [parho apne Rab ke naam se jis ne paida kiya]. To Abu Salama ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah se is ke bare mein poochha aur un se waisa hi kaha jaisa tum ne kaha. To Jabir ne kaha: Main tumhe wahi bayan karunga jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein bayan farmaya. Aap ne farmaya: Main ne Hira mein khalwat ikhtiyar ki. Phir jab main ne apni khalwat poori ki to main utra aur mujhe pukara gaya. To main ne apne dayein dekha to kuchh na dekha, apne bayein dekha to kuchh na dekha, apne samne dekha to kuchh na dekha, apne peechhe dekha to kuchh na dekha. Phir main ne apna sar uthaya to ek cheez dekhi. To main Khadija ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Mujhe chadar odhao aur mujh par thanda pani dalo. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne mujhe chadar odhayi aur mujh par thanda pani dala. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ye nazil hui [ae chadar odhne wale! Khade ho aur darao, aur apne Rab ki badayi bayan karo]."
"102","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Makkah mein jab main tha to mere ghar ki chhat kholi gayi. To Jibreel nazil hue aur unhon ne mera seena khola, phir use Zamzam ke pani se dhoya. Phir sone ka ek tasht laye jo hikmat aur iman se bhara tha, phir use mere seene mein undel diya, phir use band kar diya. Phir unhon ne mera hath pakda aur mujhe pehle aasman ki taraf le gaye. Phir jab main pehle aasman par aaya to Jibreel ne aasman ke darban se kaha: Kholo. Us ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Jibreel hain. Us ne kaha: Kya tumhare sath koi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, mere sath Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hain. To us ne kaha: Kya unhe bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Phir jab us ne khola to hum pehle aasman par chadhe. To ek shakhs baitha tha, us ke dayein siyah parchaaiyan aur us ke bayein siyah parchaaiyan thein. Jab wo apne dayein dekhta to hansta, aur jab apne bayein dekhta to rota. To us ne kaha: Saleh Nabi aur saleh bete ko khush-aamdeed. Main ne Jibreel se poochha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Adam hain, aur un ke dayein aur bayein ye siyah parchaaiyan un ki aulad ki roohein hain. Un mein se dayein walے Jannat wale hain, aur bayein wali siyah parchaaiyan Dozakh wale hain. Phir jab wo apne dayein dekhte hain to hanste hain, aur jab apne bayein dekhte hain to rote hain. Phir wo mujhe doosre aasman tak le gaye aur us ke darban se kaha: Kholo. To us ke darban ne un se waisa hi kaha jaisa pehle ne kaha tha. To us ne khola. Rawi Anas ne kaha: Phir unhon ne zikr kiya ke unhon ne aasmanon mein Adam, Idris, Musa, Isa aur Ibrahim (alaihimussalam) ko paya, aur un ke darjon ko sabit na kiya, magar unhon ne zikr kiya ke unhon ne Adam ko pehle aasman mein aur Ibrahim ko chhathe aasman mein paya. Anas ne kaha: Phir jab Jibreel Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko lekar Idris ke paas se guzre to unhon ne kaha: Saleh Nabi aur saleh bhai ko khush-aamdeed. Main ne poochha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Idris hain. Phir main Musa ke paas se guzra to unhon ne kaha: Saleh Nabi aur saleh bhai ko khush-aamdeed. Main ne poochha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Musa hain. Phir main Isa ke paas se guzra to unhon ne kaha: Saleh bhai ko khush-aamdeed [aur mukammal hadith sanad ke sath hai]."
"103","[AI-translation] Hazrat Malik bin Sa'sa'a (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main Kaaba ke paas neend aur bedari ke darmiyan tha, aur do mardon ke darmiyan ka zikr kiya. To mere paas sone ka ek tasht laya gaya jo hikmat aur iman se bhara tha. Phir mera seena gale se pet ke narm hisse tak cheera gaya, phir pet Zamzam ke pani se dhoya gaya, phir use hikmat aur iman se bhar diya gaya. Aur mere paas ek safed sawari layi gayi jo khachchar se chhoti aur gadhe se badi thi, Buraq. Phir main Jibreel ke sath chala yahan tak ke hum pehle aasman par aaye. Poochha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Poochha gaya: Tumhare sath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad. Poochha gaya: Kya unhe bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Poochha gaya: Unhe khush-aamdeed aur kya hi acha aana hua. Phir main Adam ke paas aaya aur unhe salam kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Bete aur Nabi ko khush-aamdeed. Phir hum doosre aasman par aaye. Poochha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Poochha gaya: Tumhare sath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam). Poochha gaya: Kya unhe bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Poochha gaya: Unhe khush-aamdeed aur kya hi acha aana hua. Phir main Isa aur Yahya ke paas aaya to un dono ne kaha: Bhai aur Nabi ko khush-aamdeed. Phir hum teesre aasman par aaye. Poochha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Kaha gaya: Jibreel. Poochha gaya: Tumhare sath kaun hai? Kaha gaya: Muhammad. Poochha gaya: Kya unhe bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Poochha gaya: Unhe khush-aamdeed aur kya hi acha aana hua. Phir main Yusuf ke paas aaya aur unhe salam kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Bhai aur Nabi ko khush-aamdeed. Phir hum chauthe aasman par aaye. Poochha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Poochha gaya: Tumhare sath kaun hai? Kaha gaya: Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam). Poochha gaya: Kya unhe bulaya gaya hai? Kaha gaya: Haan. Poochha gaya: Unhe khush-aamdeed aur kya hi acha aana hua. Phir main Idris ke paas aaya aur unhe salam kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Bhai aur Nabi ko khush-aamdeed. Phir hum panchwen aasman par aaye. Poochha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Poochha gaya: Tumhare sath kaun hai? Kaha gaya: Muhammad. Poochha gaya: Kya unhe bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Poochha gaya: Unhe khush-aamdeed aur kya hi acha aana hua. Phir hum Haroon ke paas aaye, main ne unhe salam kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Bhai aur Nabi ko khush-aamdeed [aur hadith mein Miraj ka baqi hissa hai]."
"104","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main ne us raat jab mujhe sair karayi gayi Musa ko dekha, ek gandum-gon shakhs, lambe, ghungrale baalon wale, goya Shanua ke mardon mein se hon. Aur main ne Isa ko dekha, ek darmiyane qad ke shakhs, darmiyane jism wale, surkhi aur safedi ki taraf mayel, seedhe baalon wale. Aur main ne Malik ko dekha jo Dozakh ke darban hain, aur Dajjal ko un nishaniyon mein jo Allah ne Aap ko dikhayein. To tum us se mulaqat ke bare mein shak mein na raho."
"105","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Mujahid ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Ibn Abbas ke paas they. To unhon ne Dajjal ka zikr kiya ke us ne kaha ke us ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan kafir likha hoga. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Main ne ye nahi suna, lekin Aap ne farmaya: Raha Musa, goya main use dekh raha hun jab wo wadi mein utre labbaik kehte hue."
"106","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us raat jab Aap ko sair karayi gayi farmaya: Main ne Musa ko dekha, ek dubla-patla seedhe baalon wala shakhs, goya Shanua ke mardon mein se hon. Aur main ne Isa ko dekha, ek darmiyane qad ka surkh shakhs, goya wo hammam se nikla ho. Aur main Ibrahim ki aulad mein un se sab se zyada mushabeh hun. Phir mere paas do bartan laye gaye, ek mein doodh tha aur doosre mein sharab thi. To kaha gaya: Jo chaaho piyo. To main ne doodh liya aur piya. To kaha gaya: Tum ne fitrat ko liya. Suno! Agar tum sharab lete to tumhari ummat gumrah ho jati."
"107","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek din logon ke samne Masih Dajjal ka zikr farmaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah kana nahi hai. Suno! Beshak Masih Dajjal dayein aankh se kana hai, goya us ki aankh ubhri hui angoor hai."
"108","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne aaj raat apne aap ko Kaaba ke paas khwab mein dekha. To ek gandum-gon shakhs, mardon ki gandumiyat mein sab se haseen, us ke lambe baal dono kandhon ke darmiyan padte they, ghungrale baal, us ke sar se pani tapak raha tha, apne dono hath do mardon ke kandhon par rakhe hue, Baitullah ka tawaf karte hue. To main ne poochha: Ye kaun hain? To unhon ne kaha: Ye Masih Ibn Maryam hain. Phir main ne us ke peechhe ek shakhs dekha, ghungrale sakht baalon wala, dayein aankh se kana, main ne dekhe hue logon mein Ibn Qatan se sab se zyada mushabeh, apne dono hath ek shakhs ke kandhon par rakhe hue, Baitullah ka tawaf karte hue. To main ne poochha: Ye kaun hai? To unhon ne kaha: Masih Dajjal."
"109","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jab Quraish ne mujhe jhutlaya to main Hijr mein khada hua. To Allah ne mere liye Bait al-Maqdis ko khol diya. Phir main unhe us ki nishaniyan batane laga jabke main use dekh raha tha."
"110","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se Abu Ishaq al-Shaibani ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zirr bin Hubaish se Allah Ta'ala ke qaul [phir wo do kamanon ke barabar ya us se qareeb ho gaya, phir Us ne apne bande ki taraf wahi ki jo wahi ki] ke bare mein poochha. Unhon ne kaha: Ibn Mas'ud ne hamein bayan kiya ke unhon ne Jibreel ko dekha, un ke chhe sau par they."
"111","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Masrooq ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha se arz kiya: Ae ammi-jaan! Kya Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne Rab ko dekha? To unhon ne farmaya: Tum ne jo kaha us se mere rongte khade ho gaye. Tum teen baton se kahan ho, jo tumhe ye bayan kare us ne jhoot bola: Jo tumhe bayan kare ke Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne Rab ko dekha us ne jhoot bola. Phir unhon ne parha [nigahen Use nahi pa sakteen jabke Wo nigahon ko pa leta hai aur Wo bareek-been khabar rakhne wala hai], [aur kisi bashar ke liye mumkin nahi ke Allah us se kalam kare magar wahi se ya parde ke peechhe se]. Aur jo tumhe bayan kare ke wo janta hai ke kal kya hai us ne jhoot bola. Phir unhon ne parha [aur koi jaan nahi janti ke wo kal kya kamayegi]. Aur jo tumhe bayan kare ke unhon ne chhupaya us ne jhoot bola. Phir unhon ne parha [ae Rasool! Pahuncha do jo tumhari taraf tumhare Rab se nazil kiya gaya] ayat tak. Lekin unhon ne Jibreel (alaihissalam) ko un ki asli surat mein do martaba dekha."
"112","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jo dawa kare ke Muhammad ne apne Rab ko dekha us ne bahut badi baat kahi. Lekin unhon ne Jibreel ko un ki asli surat mein dekha, aur un ka wujood ufuq ke darmiyan ko ghere hue tha."
"113","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Chandi ki do Jannatein hain, un ke bartan aur jo un mein hai, aur sone ki do Jannatein hain, un ke bartan aur jo un mein hai. Aur qaum ke aur apne Rab ko dekhne ke darmiyan Jannat-e-Adn mein Us ke chehre par kibriyayi ki chadar ke siwa kuchh nahi hoga."
"114","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke logon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya hum Qayamat ke din apne Rab ko dekhenge? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum chaand ke bare mein jhagadte ho jab wo chaundhween ka ho aur us ke aage badal na ho? Unhon ne arz kiya: Nahi Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: To kya tum suraj ke bare mein jhagadte ho jab us ke aage badal na ho? Unhon ne arz kiya: Nahi Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: To tum Use aise hi dekhoge. Qayamat ke din log jama kiye jayenge. To Wo farmayega: Jo kisi cheez ki ibadat karta tha use chahiye ke us ke peechhe chale. To un mein se koi suraj ke peechhe chalega, koi chaand ke peechhe chalega, koi taghooton ke peechhe chalega. Aur ye ummat baqi rahegi jis mein us ke munafiq honge. Phir Allah un ke paas aayega aur farmayega: Main tumhara Rab hun. To wo kahenge: Ye hamari jagah hai yahan tak ke hamara Rab hamare paas aaye. Phir jab hamara Rab aayega to hum use pehchan lenge. Phir Allah un ke paas aayega aur farmayega: Main tumhara Rab hun. To wo kahenge: Tu hamara Rab hai. Phir Wo unhe bulayega aur Jahannam ke upar pul rakha jayega. To main Rasoolon mein se apni ummat ke sath guzarne wala pehla hunga. Aur us din Rasoolon ke siwa koi baat nahi karega, aur Rasoolon ki baat us din hogi: Ae Allah! Salamti de, salamti de. Aur Jahannam mein Sa'dan ke kaante jaisi kundiayan hain. Kya tum ne Sa'dan ka kaanta dekha hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo Sa'dan ke kaante jaisi hain, magar us ki badayi ka andaza Allah ke siwa koi nahi janta. Wo logon ko un ke aamal se uchak lengi. To un mein se koi apne amal se halak hoga, koi zakhmi hokar phir najaat payega. Yahan tak ke jab Allah Dozakh walon mein se jis par chahega rehem karna chahega to Allah farishton ko hukm dega ke jo Allah ki ibadat karta tha use nikalo. To wo unhe nikalenge aur unhe sajde ke nishanon se pehchanenge. Aur Allah ne Aag par sajde ke nishan ko khana haram kar diya hai. Phir wo Aag se niklenge. Ibn Adam ke har hisse ko Aag khayegi magar sajde ke nishan ko. Phir wo Aag se niklenge jabke wo jal chuke honge. To un par Aab-e-Hayat dala jayega. Phir wo aise ugenge jaise dana sailab ke bahao mein ugta hai. Phir Allah bandon ke darmiyan faisle se farigh hoga. Aur ek shakhs Jannat aur Dozakh ke darmiyan baqi rahega, jo Dozakh walon mein sab se aakhir mein Jannat mein dakhil hone wala hoga, apne chehre se Aag ki taraf mutawajjah. To wo arz karega: Ae mere Rab! Mera chehra Aag se pher de. Us ki hawa ne mujhe be-hal kar diya hai aur us ki lapak ne mujhe jala diya hai. To Wo farmayega: Kya mumkin hai ke agar tumhare sath ye kiya jaye to tum is ke siwa kuchh mangoge? To wo arz karega: Teri izzat ki qasam! Nahi. Phir wo Allah ko jo Wo chahega ahad aur paiman dega. To Allah us ka chehra Aag se pher dega. Phir jab wo Jannat ki taraf mutawajjah hoga aur us ki raunaq dekhega to jitna Allah chahega khamosh rahega, phir arz karega: Ae mere Rab! Mujhe Jannat ke darwaze ke paas kar de. To Allah use farmayega: Kya tum ne ahad aur paiman nahi diye they ke tum us ke siwa kuchh nahi mangoge jo tum ne manga tha? To wo arz karega: Ae mere Rab! Main teri makhlooq mein sab se bad-naseeb na banun. To Wo farmayega: Phir kya mumkin hai ke agar tumhe ye diya jaye to tum is ke siwa kuchh na mangoge? To wo arz karega: Teri izzat ki qasam! Main is ke siwa kuchh nahi mangunga. Phir wo apne Rab ko jo Wo chahega ahad aur paiman dega. To Wo use Jannat ke darwaze tak kar dega. Phir jab wo us ke darwaze par pahunchega aur us ki taazgi aur jo us mein khushi aur suroor hai dekhega to jitna Allah chahega khamosh rahega. Phir arz karega: Ae mere Rab! Mujhe Jannat mein dakhil kar de. To Allah farmayega: Ibn Adam par afsos! Tum kitne ahad-shikan ho! Kya tum ne ahad aur paiman nahi diye they ke tum us ke siwa kuchh nahi mangoge jo tumhe diya gaya? To wo arz karega: Ae mere Rab! Mujhe apni makhlooq mein sab se bad-naseeb na bana. To Allah Azza wa Jalla us par hansega, phir use Jannat mein dakhil hone ki ijazat dega. Phir farmayega: Tamanna karo. To wo tamanna karega yahan tak ke jab us ki tamannayein khatm ho jayengi to Allah Azza wa Jalla farmayega: Falan aur falan se, us ka Rab use yaad dilayega. Yahan tak ke jab us ki aarzooein khatm ho jayengi to Allah Ta'ala farmayega: Tumhare liye ye hai aur is ke sath is jaisa."
"115","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya hum Qayamat ke din apne Rab ko dekhenge? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum suraj aur chaand ko dekhne mein takleef uthate ho jab aasman saaf ho? Hum ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To tum us din apne Rab ko dekhne mein is se zyada takleef nahi uthaoge jitni un dono ko dekhne mein uthate ho. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Ek pukarne wala pukarega: Har qaum use chahiye ke us ki taraf jaye jis ki wo ibadat karti thi. To saleeb wale apni saleeb ke sath jayenge, buton wale apne buton ke sath jayenge, har mabood wale apne maboodon ke sath jayenge. Yahan tak ke jo Allah ki ibadat karta tha, neki karne wala ho ya gunahgar, aur Ahle Kitab mein se bache-khuche baqi reh jayenge. Phir Jahannam layi jayegi jo aise pesh ki jayegi goya wo sarab hai. Phir Yahood se kaha jayega: Tum kis ki ibadat karte they? Wo kahenge: Hum Uzair Ibn Allah ki ibadat karte they. To kaha jayega: Tum ne jhoot bola, Allah ki na biwi hai aur na beta. Phir tum kya chahte ho? Wo kahenge: Hum chahte hain ke Tu hamein pani pilaye. To kaha jayega: Piyo. Phir wo Jahannam mein girte jayenge. Phir Nasara se kaha jayega: Tum kis ki ibadat karte they? To wo kahenge: Hum Masih Ibn Allah ki ibadat karte they. To kaha jayega: Tum ne jhoot bola, Allah ki na biwi hai aur na beta. Phir tum kya chahte ho? To wo kahenge: Hum chahte hain ke Tu hamein pani pilaye. To kaha jayega: Piyo. Phir wo Jahannam mein girte jayenge. Yahan tak ke jo Allah ki ibadat karta tha, neki karne wala ho ya gunahgar, baqi reh jayega. To un se kaha jayega: Tumhe kya rokta hai jabke log chale gaye? To wo kahenge: Hum un se juda hue jabke hum aaj un se zyada Us ke mohtaj hain. Aur hum ne ek pukarne wale ko suna jo pukar raha tha: Har qaum use chahiye ke us se mile jis ki wo ibadat karti thi. Aur hum to apne Rab ka intezar karte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Phir un ke paas al-Jabbar aayega, us surat ke siwa jis mein unhon ne Use pehli martaba dekha tha. To Wo farmayega: Main tumhara Rab hun. To wo kahenge: Tu hamara Rab hai. To Us se Ambiya ke siwa koi kalam nahi karega. To Wo farmayega: Kya tumhare aur Us ke darmiyan koi alamat hai jis se tum Use pehchante ho? To wo kahenge: Pindli. Phir Wo apni pindli kholega. To har momin Use sajda karega. Aur jo Allah ke liye riyakari aur shohrat se sajda karta tha wo baqi reh jayega. Phir wo sajda karne ke liye jayega to us ki peeth ek takhta ho jayegi. Phir pul laya jayega aur Jahannam ke darmiyan rakha jayega. Hum ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Pul kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Phisalne aur fisalane ki jagah. Us par kundiayan aur aankde honge, aur ek chapta kharposh hoga jis mein teda kaanta hoga jo Najd mein hota hai jise Sa'dan kaha jata hai. Momin us par palak jhapakne, bijli, hawa, umda ghodon aur sawariyon ki tarah hoga. Phir koi najaat pane wala mehfooz, koi najaat pane wala zakhmi, aur koi Jahannam ki aag mein gira hua. Yahan tak ke un mein se aakhri ghisat kar guzrega. To tum haq mein mujh se us din al-Jabbar se sawal karne mein momin se zyada sakht nahi hoge jo tum par wazeh ho gaya hai. Phir jab wo dekhenge ke wo najaat pa gaye aur un ke bhai baqi reh gaye to kahenge: Ae hamare Rab! Hamare bhai hamare sath namaz parhte they, hamare sath roze rakhte they aur hamare sath amal karte they. To Allah Ta'ala farmayega: Jao, jis ke dil mein tum deenar ke wazan ke barabar iman pao use nikal lo. Aur Allah un ki surton ko Aag par haram kar dega. Phir wo un ke paas aayenge jabke un mein se kuchh Aag mein apne qadmon tak aur apni pindliyon ke aadhe tak dhans chuke honge. Phir wo jinhe pehchanenge unhe nikalenge. Phir lautenge to Wo farmayega: Jao, jis ke dil mein tum aadhe deenar ke wazan ke barabar pao use nikal lo. Phir wo jinhe pehchanenge unhe nikalenge. Phir lautenge to Wo farmayega: Jao, jis ke dil mein tum zarre ke wazan ke barabar iman pao use nikal lo. Phir wo jinhe pehchanenge unhe nikalenge. Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Phir agar tum meri tasdeeq na karo to parho [beshak Allah zarre ke wazan ke barabar zulm nahi karta, aur agar neki ho to use dugna karta hai]. Phir Nabi, farishte aur momin shafa'at karenge. To al-Jabbar farmayega: Meri shafa'at baqi hai. Phir Wo Aag se ek mutthi bharega aur aise logon ko nikalega jo jal chuke honge. Phir wo Jannat ke dahane par ek nahar mein dale jayenge jise Aab-e-Hayat kaha jata hai. Phir wo us ke kinaron mein aise ugenge jaise dana sailab ke bahao mein ugta hai. Tum ne use chattaan ke kinare, darakht ke kinare dekha hoga. Jo us mein se dhoop ki taraf hota hai wo sabz hota hai, aur jo us mein se saye ki taraf hota hai wo safed hota hai. Phir wo aise niklenge goya wo moti hain. Phir un ki gardanon mein mohrein dali jayengi. Phir wo Jannat mein dakhil honge. To Jannat wale kahenge: Ye Rahman ke aazad kiye hue hain, Allah ne unhe Jannat mein baghair kisi amal ke jo unhon ne kiya aur baghair kisi bhalayi ke jo unhon ne aage bheji dakhil kiya. Phir un se kaha jayega: Tumhare liye jo tum ne dekha aur us ke sath is jaisa."
"116","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jannat wale Jannat mein dakhil honge aur Dozakh wale Dozakh mein. Phir Allah Ta'ala farmayega: Jis ke dil mein rai ke dane ke wazan ke barabar iman ho use nikal lo. Phir wo is se nikale jayenge jabke wo siyah ho chuke honge. Phir wo Haya ya Hayat ki nahar mein dale jayenge [sanad ke ek rawi ko shak hai]. Phir wo aise ugenge jaise dana sailab ke kinare ugta hai. Kya tum ne nahi dekha ke wo peeli bal khayi hui nikalti hai?"
"117","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main Dozakh se nikalne mein sab se aakhri aur Jannat mein dakhil hone mein sab se aakhri shakhs ko janta hun. Ek shakhs Dozakh se ghisat kar niklega. To Allah farmayega: Jao aur Jannat mein dakhil ho jao. Phir wo us ke paas aayega to use khayal hoga ke wo bhari hui hai. Phir wo lautega aur arz karega: Ae mere Rab! Main ne use bhara hua paya. To Wo farmayega: Jao aur Jannat mein dakhil ho jao. Phir wo us ke paas aayega to use khayal hoga ke wo bhari hui hai. Phir wo lautega aur arz karega: Ae mere Rab! Main ne use bhara hua paya. To Wo farmayega: Jao aur Jannat mein dakhil ho jao. Beshak tumhare liye duniya ke barabar aur us ke dus guna hai, ya beshak tumhare liye duniya ke dus guna ke barabar hai. To wo arz karega: Tu mujh se mazaq karta hai ya mujh par hansta hai jabke Tu Badshah hai? Rawi ne kaha: Phir main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke Aap hanse yahan tak ke Aap ki dadhon ke kinare zahir ho gaye. Aur kaha jata tha: Ye Jannat walon mein sab se kam darje wala hai."
"118","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Qayamat ke din logon ko jama karega. Phir wo kahenge: Kash hum apne Rab se shafa'at talab karein yahan tak ke Wo hamein hamari jagah se rahat de. Phir wo Adam ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Tum wo ho jise Allah ne apne hath se paida kiya, tum mein apni rooh phunki, aur farishton ko hukm diya to unhon ne tumhe sajda kiya. To hamare liye hamare Rab ke paas shafa'at karo. To wo kahenge: Main is ke qabil nahi, aur apni khata yaad karenge. Aur kahenge: Nuh ke paas jao, pehle Rasool jinhe Allah ne bheja. Phir wo un ke paas aayenge to wo kahenge: Main is ke qabil nahi, aur apni khata yaad karenge. Ibrahim ke paas jao jinhe Allah ne khalil banaya. Phir wo un ke paas aayenge to wo kahenge: Main is ke qabil nahi, aur apni khata yaad karenge. Musa ke paas jao jin se Allah ne kalam kiya. Phir wo un ke paas aayenge to wo kahenge: Main is ke qabil nahi, aur apni khata yaad karenge. Isa ke paas jao. Phir wo un ke paas aayenge to wo kahenge: Main is ke qabil nahi, Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas jao, un ke agle aur pichhle gunah bakhsh diye gaye hain. Phir wo mere paas aayenge. To main apne Rab se ijazat mangunga. Phir jab main Use dekhunga to sajde mein gir jaunga. Phir Wo mujhe jitna chahega chhorega. Phir kaha jayega: Apna sar uthao, mango diye jaoge, kaho suna jayega, shafa'at karo qubool ki jayegi. Phir main apna sar uthaunga aur apne Rab ki aisi hamd karunga jo Wo mujhe sikhayega. Phir main shafa'at karunga to Wo mere liye ek had muqarrar farmayega. Phir main unhe Aag se nikalunga aur Jannat mein dakhil karunga. Phir main lautunga aur teesri ya chauthi martaba is jaisa sajde mein girunga, yahan tak ke Aag mein sirf wo baqi reh jayega jise Quran ne rok rakha hai [yani hamesha rehne wale]."
"119","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein bayan farmaya, Aap ne farmaya: Jab Qayamat ka din hoga to log ek doosre mein mauj marenge. Phir wo Adam ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Hamare liye apne Rab se shafa'at karo. To wo kahenge: Main is ke qabil nahi, lekin tum par Ibrahim lazim hain kyunke wo Rahman ke khalil hain. Phir wo Ibrahim ke paas aayenge. To wo kahenge: Main is ke qabil nahi, lekin tum par Musa lazim hain kyunke wo Allah se kalam karne wale hain. Phir wo Musa ke paas aayenge. To wo kahenge: Main is ke qabil nahi, lekin tum par Isa lazim hain kyunke wo Allah ki rooh aur Us ka kalima hain. Phir wo Isa ke paas aayenge to wo kahenge: Main is ke qabil nahi, lekin tum par Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) lazim hain. Phir wo mere paas aayenge to main kahunga: Main is ke liye hun. Phir main apne Rab se ijazat mangunga to mujhe ijazat di jayegi. Aur Wo mujhe aisi hamdein ilham farmayega jin se main Us ki hamd karunga jo mujhe ab yaad nahi. Phir main Us ki un hamdon se hamd karunga aur Us ke liye sajde mein gir jaunga. To kaha jayega: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthao aur kaho suna jayega, mango diye jaoge, shafa'at karo qubool ki jayegi. To main arz karunga: Ae mere Rab! Meri ummat, meri ummat. To kaha jayega: Jao aur jis ke dil mein jau ke dane ke wazan ke barabar iman ho use nikal lo. Phir main jaunga aur aisa karunga. Phir main lautunga aur Us ki un hamdon se hamd karunga, phir Us ke liye sajde mein gir jaunga. To kaha jayega: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthao, kaho suna jayega, mango diye jaoge, shafa'at karo qubool ki jayegi. To main arz karunga: Ae mere Rab! Meri ummat, meri ummat. To kaha jayega: Jao aur is mein se jis ke dil mein zarre ya rai ke dane ke wazan ke barabar iman ho use nikal lo. Phir main jaunga aur aisa karunga. Phir main lautunga aur Us ki un hamdon se hamd karunga, phir Us ke liye sajde mein gir jaunga. To kaha jayega: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthao, kaho suna jayega, mango diye jaoge, shafa'at karo qubool ki jayegi. To main arz karunga: Ae mere Rab! Meri ummat, meri ummat. To kaha jayega: Jao aur jis ke dil mein rai ke dane ke wazan ke sab se kam se kam se kam iman ho use Aag se nikal lo. Phir main jaunga aur aisa karunga. Phir main chauthi martaba lautunga aur Us ki un hamdon se hamd karunga, phir Us ke liye sajde mein gir jaunga. To kaha jayega: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthao, kaho suna jayega, mango diye jaoge, shafa'at karo qubool ki jayegi. To main arz karunga: Ae mere Rab! Mujhe us ke bare mein ijazat de jo La ilaha illallah kahe. To Wo farmayega: Meri izzat, jalal, kibriyayi aur azmat ki qasam! Main is mein se usے zaroor nikalunga jo La ilaha illallah kahe."
"120","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas gosht laya gaya. To Aap ki taraf dasti pesh ki gayi jo Aap ko pasand thi. To Aap ne us mein se ek luqma toda, phir farmaya: Main Qayamat ke din logon ka sardar hun. Aur kya tum jante ho ye kis wajah se hai? Pehle aur pichhle log ek maidان mein jama kiye jayenge. Pukarne wala unhe sunayega aur nazar unhe gheregi, aur suraj qareeb ho jayega. Phir logon ko gham aur takleef itni pahunchegi jitni wo bardasht nahi kar sakenge aur seh nahi sakenge. To log kahenge: Kya tum nahi dekhte jo tumhe pahunch chuka hai? Kya tum nahi dekhte kaun tumhare liye tumhare Rab se shafa'at kare? Phir kuchh log ek doosre se kahenge: Tum par Adam lazim hain. Phir wo Adam (alaihissalam) ke paas aayenge. To un se kahenge: Tum bashar ke baap ho, Allah ne tumhe apne hath se paida kiya, tum mein apni rooh phunki, aur farishton ko hukm diya to unhon ne tumhe sajda kiya. Hamare liye hamare Rab se shafa'at karo. Kya tum nahi dekhte hum kis mein hain? Kya tum nahi dekhte jo hamein pahunch chuka hai? To Adam kahenge: Beshak mere Rab ne aaj itna ghazab farmaya hai jitna is se pehle kabhi nahi farmaya aur is ke baad kabhi nahi farmayega. Aur beshak Us ne mujhe darakht se mana kiya tha to main ne Us ki na-farmani ki. Meri jaan, meri jaan, meri jaan. Mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao, Nuh ke paas jao. Phir wo Nuh ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Nuh! Beshak tum zameen walon ki taraf pehle Rasool ho, aur Allah ne tumhe shukr-guzar banda kaha hai. Hamare liye hamare Rab se shafa'at karo. Kya tum nahi dekhte hum kis mein hain? To wo kahenge: Beshak mere Rab Azza wa Jalla ne aaj itna ghazab farmaya hai jitna is se pehle kabhi nahi farmaya aur is ke baad kabhi nahi farmayega. Aur beshak meri ek dua thi jo main ne apni qaum par ki thi. Meri jaan, meri jaan, meri jaan. Mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao, Ibrahim ke paas jao. Phir wo Ibrahim ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Ibrahim! Tum Allah ke Nabi aur zameen walon mein se Us ke khalil ho. Hamare liye hamare Rab se shafa'at karo. Kya tum nahi dekhte hum kis mein hain? To wo un se kahenge: Beshak mere Rab ne aaj itna ghazab farmaya hai jitna is se pehle kabhi nahi farmaya, aur is ke baad kabhi nahi farmayega. Aur beshak main ne teen jhoot bole they. Meri jaan, meri jaan, meri jaan. Mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao, Musa ke paas jao. Phir wo Musa ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Musa! Tum Allah ke Rasool ho, Allah ne tumhe apne paigham aur apne kalam se logon par fazilat di hai. Hamare liye hamare Rab se shafa'at karo. Kya tum nahi dekhte hum kis mein hain? To wo kahenge: Beshak mere Rab ne aaj itna ghazab farmaya hai jitna is se pehle kabhi nahi farmaya, aur is ke baad kabhi nahi farmayega. Aur beshak main ne ek jaan qatl ki thi jis ke qatl ka mujhe hukm nahi diya gaya tha. Meri jaan, meri jaan, meri jaan. Mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao, Isa ke paas jao. Phir wo Isa ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Isa! Tum Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Us ka kalima ho jise Us ne Maryam ki taraf dala aur Us ki taraf se ek rooh ho, aur tum ne jhoole mein bachche ki haalat mein logon se kalam kiya. Hamare liye shafa'at karo. Kya tum nahi dekhte hum kis mein hain? To Isa kahenge: Beshak mere Rab ne aaj itna ghazab farmaya hai jitna is se pehle kabhi nahi farmaya aur is ke baad kabhi nahi farmayega. Aur unhon ne koi gunah zikr nahi kiya. Meri jaan, meri jaan, meri jaan. Mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao, Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas jao. Phir wo Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Muhammad! Tum Allah ke Rasool aur Ambiya ke khatim ho, aur Allah ne tumhare agle aur pichhle gunah bakhsh diye hain. Hamare liye hamare Rab se shafa'at karo. Kya tum nahi dekhte hum kis mein hain? Phir main chalunga aur Arsh ke neeche aaunga aur apne Rab Azza wa Jalla ke liye sajde mein gir jaunga. Phir Allah mujh par apni hamdon aur Us ki achhi sana mein se kuchh kholega jo Us ne mujh se pehle kisi par nahi khola. Phir kaha jayega: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthao, mango diye jaoge, shafa'at karo qubool ki jayegi. Phir main apna sar uthaunga aur arz karunga: Meri ummat, ae mere Rab! Meri ummat, ae mere Rab! To kaha jayega: Ae Muhammad! Apni ummat mein se jin par hisab nahi unhe Jannat ke darwazon mein se dayein darwaze se dakhil karo. Aur wo is ke siwa baqi darwazon mein logon ke shareek hain. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak Jannat ke darwazon ke do paton ke darmiyan itna fasla hai jitna Makkah aur Himyar ke darmiyan hai, ya jitna Makkah aur Busra ke darmiyan hai."
"121","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har Nabi ki ek dua hai. To main chahta hun, agar Allah ne chaha, ke apni dua Qayamat ke din apni ummat ke liye shafa'at ke liye chhupa kar rakhun."
"122","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Har Nabi ne ek sawal manga, ya farmaya: Har Nabi ki ek dua hai jo us ne mangi aur qubool ki gayi. To main ne apni dua Qayamat ke din apni ummat ke liye shafa'at banayi."
"123","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hue jab Allah Azza wa Jalla ne ye nazil farmaya [aur apne qareebi rishtedaron ko darao]. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Quraish ki jamaat! Ya is jaisa kalima. Apni jaanon ko khareed lo, main Allah ke samne tumhare kuchh kaam nahi aaunga. Ae Bani Abd Manaf! Main Allah ke samne tumhare kuchh kaam nahi aaunga. Ae Abbas bin Abd al-Muttalib! Main Allah ke samne tumhare kuchh kaam nahi aaunga. Aur ae Safiyya, Rasulullah ki phuphi! Main Allah ke samne tumhare kuchh kaam nahi aaunga. Aur ae Fatima bint Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Mere maal mein se jo chaaho mang lo, main Allah ke samne tumhare kuchh kaam nahi aaungi."
"124","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye nazil hui [aur apne qareebi rishtedaron ko darao] aur un mein se tumhare khalis rishtedar, to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nikle yahan tak ke Safa par chadhe aur pukara: Subah ki museebat! To unhon ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? Phir wo Aap ke paas jama ho gaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Batayo, agar main tumhe khabar dun ke is pahad ke daaman se ghod-sawar nikalne wale hain to kya tum meri tasdeeq karoge? Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne tum par kabhi jhoot ka tajurba nahi kiya. Aap ne farmaya: To beshak main tumhare liye sakht azab se pehle darane wala hun. To Abu Lahab ne kaha: Tumhare liye halakat ho! Tum ne hamein sirf is liye jama kiya? Phir wo khada hua. Phir ye nazil hui [Abu Lahab ke dono hath toot jayein aur wo halak ho]."
"125","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abbas bin Abd al-Muttalib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya: Tum ne apne chacha ke kya kaam aaye jabke wo tumhari hifazat karta tha aur tumhare liye ghussa karta tha? Aap ne farmaya: Wo aag ke uthle hisse mein hai, aur agar main na hota to wo aag ke sab se nichle garhe mein hota."
"126","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, aur Aap ke paas Aap ke chacha ka zikr hua. To Aap ne farmaya: Shayad Qayamat ke din meri shafa'at use faida de, phir wo aag ke uthle hisse mein kar diya jayega jo us ke takhnon tak pahunchegi, jis se us ka dimagh ubalega."
"127","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Beshak Dozakh walon mein Qayamat ke din azab mein sab se halka wo shakhs hoga jis ke dono qadmon ke talwon mein angara rakha jayega jis se us ka dimagh ubalega."
"128","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin al-Aas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko elaniya, poshida nahi, farmate hue suna: Beshak Abu Fulan ki aal mere dost nahi hain. Beshak mera dost Allah aur saleh momin hain. Lekin un se mera rishtedari ka rishta hai jisے main us ki tari se bhigoonga, yani main sila-rahmi se use jodunga."
"129","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Meri ummat mein se ek jamaat dakhil hogi, wo sattar hazar hain, un ke chehre chaundhween ke chaand ki roshni ki tarah chamkenge. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Phir Ukasha bin Mihsan al-Asadi khade hue jabke un par dharidar chadar thi. To unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua farmayiye ke Wo mujhe un mein se bana de. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Use un mein se bana de. Phir Ansar mein se ek shakhs khada hua aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua farmayiye ke Wo mujhe un mein se bana de. To Aap ne farmaya: Ukasha tum se sabqat le gaya."
"130","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se sattar hazar, ya saat lakh [rawi nahi janta ke in dono mein se kaun sa kaha] Jannat mein zaroor dakhil honge. Ek doosre ko pakde hue, ek doosre ka hath pakde hue. Un mein se pehla dakhil nahi hoga yahan tak ke aakhri dakhil ho jaye. Un ke chehre chaundhween ke chaand ki surat par honge."
"131","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek din Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare paas nikle aur farmaya: Mere samne ummatein pesh ki gayein. Phir Nabi guzarte, un ke sath ek shakhs hota, Nabi un ke sath do shakhs hote, Nabi un ke sath giroh hota, aur Nabi un ke sath koi na hota. Aur main ne ek badi siyah jamaat dekhi jis ne ufuq ko gher rakha tha. To main ne ummeed ki ke wo meri ummat hogi. To kaha gaya: Ye Musa aur un ki qaum hai. Phir mujh se kaha gaya: Dekho. To main ne ek badi siyah jamaat dekhi jis ne ufuq ko gher rakha tha. To mujh se kaha gaya: Aise aur aise dekho. To main ne ek badi siyah jamaat dekhi jis ne ufuq ko gher rakha tha. To kaha gaya: Ye tumhari ummat hai. Aur in ke sath sattar hazar hain jo baghair hisab Jannat mein dakhil honge. Phir log muntashir ho gaye aur Aap ne unhe wazahat na farmayi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sathiyon ne baham guftagu ki. To unhon ne kaha: Rahe hum, hum shirk mein paida hue, lekin hum Allah aur Us ke Rasool par iman laye. Lekin ye hamari aulad hain. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye baat pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo hain jo bad-faali nahi lete, dam nahi karate, daagh nahi lagwate aur apne Rab par tawakkul karte hain. Phir Ukasha bin Mihsan khade hue aur arz kiya: Kya main un mein se hun Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Phir doosra khada hua aur arz kiya: Kya main un mein se hun? To Aap ne farmaya: Ukasha tum se sabqat le gaya."
"132","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek khaime mein they. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi ho ke tum Jannat walon ka chauthayi ho? Hum ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi ho ke tum Jannat walon ka tihayi ho? Hum ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi ho ke tum Jannat walon ka aadha ho? Hum ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Beshak main ummeed rakhta hun ke tum Jannat walon ka nisf hoge. Aur ye is liye ke Jannat mein sirf musalman jaan dakhil hogi. Aur mushrikon mein tumhari misal siyah bail ki khaal mein safed baal jaisi hai, ya surkh bail ki khaal mein siyah baal jaisi hai."
"133","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah farmayega: Ae Adam! To wo arz karenge: Labbaik wa sa'daik, aur bhalayi Tere hath mein hai. Unhon ne kaha: Wo farmayega: Dozakh ka hissa nikalo. Wo arz karenge: Dozakh ka hissa kya hai? Wo farmayega: Har hazar mein se nau sau ninyanwe. Phir wo waqt hai jab bachcha budha ho jayega, har hamla wali apna hamal gira degi, aur tum logon ko nashe mein dekhoge jabke wo nashe mein nahi honge, lekin Allah ka azab sakht hai. Phir ye un par bhari guzra. To unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Hum mein se wo shakhs kaun hoga? Aap ne farmaya: Khush ho jao, kyunke Yajuj aur Majuj mein se hazaar aur tum mein se ek shakhs hoga. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main ummeed rakhta hun ke tum Jannat walon ka tihayi hoge. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum ne Allah ki hamd ki aur takbeer kahi. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main ummeed rakhta hun ke tum Jannat walon ka nisf hoge. Beshak ummaton mein tumhari misal siyah bail ki khaal mein safed baal jaisi hai, ya gadhe ke bazu mein nishan jaisi hai."
